# === Lume Capital — TWM structural variant — deploy allowlist ===
# Same pattern as the main repo: only the built pages and the assets they reference are
# tracked. Everything else stays local.

# 1) Ignore everything by default
/*

# 2) Repo essentials
!.gitignore
!README.md
!lume.css

# 3) Pages
!index.html
!about.html
!services.html
!team.html
!contact.html

# 4) Root-level assets referenced by the pages
!nwm-logo-horizontal-white.svg
